#: include/defs/uistr.h:317
msgid "Failed to execute '%s': command not found."
msgstr "Non se puido executar '%s': orde non atopada."

#: include/defs/uistr.h:324
msgid "Alack!  The oracle 'fortune' abideth not upon this machine, wherefore no wisdom of the ancients may this day be divined.  Prithee, entreat thy package steward with an incantation such as 'sudo apt install fortune-mod' (or whate'er charm thy distribution demandeth), that the sages of yore might once more speak through this humble dialog."
msgstr "Ai de min!  O oráculo 'fortune' non mora nesta máquina, polo que ningunha sabedoría dos antigos poderá hoxe ser adiviñada.  Rógovos que supliquedes ao voso xestor de paquetes cun conxuro tal coma 'sudo apt install fortune-mod' (ou o feitizo que a vosa distribución esixa), para que os sabios de outrora poidan de novo falar a través deste humilde diálogo."
